</ul>
<h2 id="help-us-sustain-our-efforts">Help us sustain our efforts</h2>
<p>Org-mode is maintained and developed by volunteers on their free time.</p>
<p>You can help us dedicate more of our time by making a donation or by
<a href="org-contribute.org">contributing</a> directly.</p>
