<h3 id="join-the-community">Join the Community</h3>
<p>Check out the list of <a href="worgers.org">Worgers and their User Pages</a> and a few <a href="org-people.org">profiles
of the Org-mode Community</a> (with photos ☺).  You can also meet other
users in the flesh at <a href="orgcamps.org">OrgCamps</a>.</p>
<h3 id="gitr-done">Git’r done!</h3>
<p>If you like losing your time by reading stuff on how to get organized,
go and check the <a href="gitrdone.org">Git’r done!</a> page.</p>
